sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant CTC as CTC Office
    participant TM as Track Model
    H->>M: step(dt, inputs)
    alt no track loaded
        M-->>H: empty outputs, no reports
    else a wayside on the line has no program
        loop each wayside of that line
            M->>W: idle(): line not ready
            W->>W: run nothing, drive nothing
        end
        M-->>H: no commands for the line, reports with ready false
        H->>CTC: reports: no PLC program
        CTC->>CTC: hold the line: no dispatch, no suggestions
        Note right of TM: Receives no switch, signal, crossing or track circuit command for the line.
        M-->>UI: NOT READY, with the reason on hover
    end
    Note over H,W: A wayside running nothing cannot transmit: its outputs are absent, not safe defaults. The other line is not held.
